WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.736 --> 00:00:01.856
- Oh! (laughing)

00:00:07.036 --> 00:00:08.026
- I'm from the East Coast,

00:00:08.026 --> 00:00:11.096
so I've heard of them,
but I've never had one.

00:00:25.407 --> 00:00:26.928
- Who thought, who put this together?

00:00:26.928 --> 00:00:28.693
I've got clam juice and tomato juice,

00:00:28.693 --> 00:00:31.072
and maggi, and, yeah.

00:00:31.072 --> 00:00:32.644
- Was someone, like, drunk, and they were

00:00:32.644 --> 00:00:34.649
just like, "Yeah, this
sounds like a good drink."

00:00:34.649 --> 00:00:35.948
- Are you serious?

00:00:35.948 --> 00:00:38.213
- This is literally,
like, a bad trip to Epcot.

00:00:38.213 --> 00:00:40.789
Like going around the world, like...

00:00:40.789 --> 00:00:42.054
- But in one drink.

00:00:42.054 --> 00:00:43.889
- Yeah, it smells like
a spicy Bloody Mary.

00:00:43.889 --> 00:00:47.291
- It smells like a really
drunk person's vomit.

00:00:47.291 --> 00:00:48.602
- (both) Cheers!
- How do you say "Cheers!"

00:00:48.607 --> 00:00:49.897
en es-pan-yol?

00:00:49.897 --> 00:00:51.022
- Salud.
- Salud.

00:00:53.322 --> 00:00:55.613
- This is refreshing as (bleep).

00:00:55.613 --> 00:00:57.116
- Wow.
- Oh, it's great.

00:00:57.116 --> 00:00:58.177
- It tastes like vomit.

00:00:58.177 --> 00:01:00.591
- It's kind of like the chola
version of a Bloody Mary.

00:01:00.591 --> 00:01:01.915
It's like what you would have when

00:01:01.915 --> 00:01:03.111
you don't wanna have, like, vodka.

00:01:03.111 --> 00:01:04.548
- If I had a choice between this and

00:01:04.548 --> 00:01:06.129
a Bloody Mary, I'm taking this.

00:01:06.129 --> 00:01:07.515
- It's, like, a little carbonated,

00:01:07.515 --> 00:01:09.384
but not, like, overly.
- I'm going for a second.

00:01:09.384 --> 00:01:11.625
- I hate it so much.
- I hate this.

00:01:11.625 --> 00:01:13.888
- It feels like a perfect summer drink.

00:01:13.888 --> 00:01:14.809
Something that you can have when

00:01:14.809 --> 00:01:16.528
it's really, really hot outside.

00:01:16.528 --> 00:01:20.742
- Keep my Worcestershire
sauce out, on my steak.

00:01:20.742 --> 00:01:21.949
Not in my drink.

00:01:21.949 --> 00:01:23.286
- Meanwhile, I love it.

00:01:23.286 --> 00:01:25.726
- I'm done with this, I can't
put more of this inside me.

00:01:25.726 --> 00:01:28.300
- I feel so bad...that's what she said.

00:01:28.300 --> 00:01:30.397
(laughing)

